{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分段落的感受短语过密，尤其S11、S12、S13，纵向交替阅读不如Y左右分栏容易快速定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段真正重要的心理判断，人物从不甘、怀念、孤独、动摇到接受并继续生活的心理因果链也更完整，尤其反复出现的「被当作自己人」把前后串成了一件事。更重要的是，X的感受细节不仅描述情绪，还具体呈现音乐如何推动情绪转变，并通过「到时出现」与乐句同步，能感受到温暖如何变成刺痛、坚定如何重新动摇。Y的左右分栏确实更容易扫读，但部分感受被概括成标签，音乐变化的过程和心理转折的细腻程度不及X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c7ade5b3-c868-4981-b4e4-0cde1be9349f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T053835041071Z", "elapsed_seconds": 65.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:39:40.728414+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "691673ec896772dd9be8b3475d521ed89f651b51a8ee622197935c068a1c875b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch